go-to: movement_spring_roll_call

@movement_spring_roll_call
title: The promised roll call
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.abortion_spring_base = 215;
Q.abortion_spring_local_bonus = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        11,
        Math.round(
            ((Number(Q.local_network) || 0) - 30) / 4
        )
    )
);
Q.abortion_spring_movement_bonus = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        8,
        Math.round(
            ((Number(Q.movement_leverage) || 0) - 45) / 6
        )
    )
);
Q.abortion_spring_psl_bonus =
    Q.psl_relation >= 50 ? 4 :
    Q.psl_relation >= 35 ? 1 : -2;
Q.abortion_spring_variance = Math.floor(
    (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 5
) - 2;
Q.abortion_spring_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460,
        Q.abortion_spring_base +
        Q.abortion_spring_local_bonus +
        Q.abortion_spring_movement_bonus +
        Q.abortion_spring_psl_bonus +
        Q.abortion_spring_variance
    )
);
Q.abortion_spring_passed =
    Q.abortion_spring_yes >= 231 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.abortion_spring_passed) {
    Q.government_delivery += 7;
    Q.feminist_trust += 8;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 5;
    Q.psl_coalition_dissent += 5;
    Q.movement_followthrough_2025 =
        "The promised spring bill passed the Sejm";
    Q.news_headline =
        "Constituency pressure moves the abortion bill through the Sejm";
} else {
    Q.feminist_trust -= 3;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
    Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
    Q.movement_followthrough_2025 =
        "The promised spring vote failed in the Sejm";
    Q.news_headline =
        "The promised spring abortion vote falls short again";
}
!}

= A date becomes a count

**[+ abortion_spring_yes +] yes** — threshold **231**.

Starting count: **[+ abortion_spring_base +]** · district pressure **+[+
abortion_spring_local_bonus +]** · movement leverage **+[+
abortion_spring_movement_bonus +]** · PSL relationship **[+
abortion_spring_psl_bonus +]** · roll-call variance **[+
abortion_spring_variance +]**.

[? if abortion_spring_passed: The Sejm passes the bill. The President and any
constitutional referral remain separate veto points; this is a parliamentary
victory, not an automatic legal endpoint.?]
[? if not abortion_spring_passed: The defeat is no longer an undated promise.
Organisers can see exactly which investments moved votes and which coalition
relationship did not.?]

