@confidence_rescue_2025
title: Supply enough votes to rescue the democratic cabinet
subtitle: About 72% of Lewica MPs vote yes; KO +6, unity −5 and Razem cooperation −6.
on-arrival: {!
Q.confidence_2025_bonus = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) * 0.72
);
Q.ko_relation += 6;
Q.party_unity -= 5;
Q.razem_cooperation -= 6;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica supplies confidence votes from outside the cabinet";
!}
go-to: confidence_2025_roll

@confidence_2025_roll
title: The June confidence roll call
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
let governingSeats = Number(Q.coalition_seats);
if (!Number.isFinite(governingSeats) || governingSeats <= 0) {
    governingSeats =
        (Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
        (Q.left_in_government ? (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) : 0);
}
const dissentLoss = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(
        (
            (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) - 30
        ) / 7
    )
);
const randomLoss = Math.floor(
    (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 6
);
Q.confidence_2025_governing_base = Math.round(governingSeats);
Q.confidence_2025_dissent_loss = dissentLoss;
Q.confidence_2025_random_loss = randomLoss;
Q.confidence_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460,
        Math.round(governingSeats) -
            dissentLoss -
            randomLoss +
            (Number(Q.confidence_2025_bonus) || 0)
    )
);
Q.confidence_abstain = Math.min(
    460 - Q.confidence_yes,
    20,
    Math.max(0, Math.round(dissentLoss / 2) + 4)
);
Q.confidence_no = Math.max(
    0,
    460 - Q.confidence_yes - Q.confidence_abstain
);
Q.confidence_threshold = 231;
Q.confidence_present = 460;
Q.government_has_confidence = Q.confidence_yes >= 231 ? 1 : 0;
Q.coalition_confidence_2025_done = 1;
if (Q.government_has_confidence) {
    Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 3;
    Q.public_trust += 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The cabinet survives with " + Q.confidence_yes + " votes";
} else {
    Q.coalition_broken = 1;
    Q.caretaker_government = 1;
    Q.left_in_government = 0;
    Q.budget = 0;
    Q.position = "Caretaker cabinet and formation talks";
    Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(70, Q.early_election_risk);
    Q.news_headline =
        "The cabinet loses confidence with " + Q.confidence_yes + " votes";
}
!}

= Confidence roll call

**Yes [+ confidence_yes +] · No [+ confidence_no +] · Abstain [+
confidence_abstain +]**

Yes count: **[+ confidence_2025_governing_base +] governing base** − **[+
confidence_2025_dissent_loss +] coalition-dissent losses** − **[+
confidence_2025_random_loss +] roll-call absences** + **[+
confidence_2025_bonus +] strategy effect**. Threshold: **231**.

[? if government_has_confidence: The cabinet survives. The vote proves 231;
it does not settle candidate strategy, delivery or trust.?]
[? if not government_has_confidence: The cabinet falls. A named constructive
replacement or the constitutional formation ladder must now find a majority.?]

- @confidence_return: Record the vote

@confidence_return
go-to: poland_event_queue

@third_way_ends
title: Third Way decides whether it still has a future
subtitle: PSL and Poland 2050 act on their own cohesion, dissent and electoral risk
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 25
order: 10
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2025 and month = 6 and coalition_confidence_2025_done = 1 and third_way_split = 0
on-arrival: {!
const thirdWayRoll =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 13) - 6;
let splitPressure =
    Math.max(0, 55 - (Number(Q.third_way_cohesion) || 0)) +
    (Number(Q.p2050_coalition_dissent) || 0) * 0.28 +
    (Number(Q.psl_coalition_dissent) || 0) * 0.24 +
    Math.max(0, 35 - (Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0)) * 0.15 +
    Math.max(0, 35 - (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0)) * 0.12 +
    thirdWayRoll;
if (!Q.government_has_confidence) splitPressure += 8;
Q.third_way_split_pressure = Math.round(splitPressure);
Q.third_way_split = splitPressure >= 46 ? 1 : 0;
Q.third_way_active = Q.third_way_split ? 0 : 1;
if (Q.third_way_split) {
    Q.third_way_cohesion -= 25;
    Q.news_headline = Q.government_has_confidence
        ? "PSL and Poland 2050 end Third Way while both remain in the parliamentary bargain"
        : "PSL and Poland 2050 end Third Way inside a government-formation crisis";
} else {
    Q.third_way_cohesion += 8;
    Q.news_headline =
        "PSL and Poland 2050 renew Third Way under a looser bilateral pact";
}
!}

= June 2025 — Two centre parties, two survival plans

[? if third_way_split and government_has_confidence: The cabinet survived the confidence vote, so
the end of an electoral brand becomes an immediate renegotiation among parties
that still supply its majority.?]
[? if third_way_split and not government_has_confidence: The cabinet has already lost confidence.
Third Way is dissolving inside formation talks, where each successor party can
sell its seats separately.?]
[? if not third_way_split: The partners choose to keep a looser common list.
Their split pressure was **[+ third_way_split_pressure +]**, not high enough to
overcome threshold fear and the value of shared parliamentary infrastructure.?]

- @td_bilateral
- @td_psl
- @td_rebuild
- @td_renewal_respect
- @td_renewal_compete

