@marriage_eu_2025
title: Europe requires recognition of EU same-sex marriages
subtitle: Administrative recognition arrives before domestic marriage equality
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 24
order: 21
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2025 and month = 11
on-arrival: european_judgment_compliance += 3; news_headline = "An EU judgment forces a practical equality decision"

= November 2025 — Recognition is not a full marriage statute

The EU ruling requires Poland to recognise same-sex marriages lawfully
concluded in another member state. The government can issue guidance now, use
the ruling to seek full marriage equality, or wait and leave couples in legal
uncertainty.

- @marriage_implement
- @marriage_bill
- @marriage_delay
- @marriage_opposition_guidance

@marriage_implement
title: Issue immediate registry guidance and defend EU rights
subtitle: Minority safety +5 and EU compliance +5; PSL −3 and Palace −2.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: minority_safety += 5; progressive_credibility += 4; european_judgment_compliance += 5; psl_relation -= 3; president_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Registries receive a rule before Parliament finds a majority"
go-to: poland_event_queue

@marriage_bill
title: Use the ruling to introduce full marriage equality
subtitle: Progressive credibility +7; coalition dissent +8, PSL −10 and Palace −5.
on-arrival: progressive_credibility += 7; feminist_trust += 3; psl_relation -= 10; government_coalition_dissent += 8; president_relation -= 5; far_right_agenda += 5; news_headline = "The European ruling becomes the opening of a domestic marriage fight"
go-to: poland_event_queue

@marriage_delay
title: Await detailed administrative and court guidance
subtitle: PSL relations +2; EU compliance −2 and progressive credibility −3.
on-arrival: european_judgment_compliance -= 2; progressive_credibility -= 3; psl_relation += 2; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "Uncertainty shifts the cost of delay onto married couples"
go-to: poland_event_queue

@marriage_opposition_guidance
title: Publish model registry guidance and litigate non-compliance
subtitle: Opposition can support couples and councils, but cannot issue a national administrative instruction. Cost: 1 resource.
view-if: left_in_government = 0
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The legal-support network cannot be financed.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; minority_safety += 3; european_judgment_compliance += 2; local_network += 3; media_capacity += 2; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Lewica gives councils and litigants a model while ministries retain executive authority"
go-to: poland_event_queue

@collective_bargaining_2025
title: The collective-bargaining framework enters force
subtitle: A labour institution, not a one-time transfer
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 24
order: 20
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2025 and month = 12 and government_party != "pis" and caretaker_government = 0
on-arrival: labor_credibility += 4; government_delivery += 3; news_headline = "A new framework can make sectoral bargaining real—or remain paper"

= December 2025 — Enforcement after enactment

The new law creates a framework for sector-wide collective bargaining, but it
will change workplaces only if unions can register agreements and public
procurement rewards compliance. Lewica can fund that work or settle for
claiming credit for the statute.

- @bargaining_enforce
- @bargaining_claim

@bargaining_enforce
title: Fund registration, procurement clauses and union organisers
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity in government, otherwise 2 resources.
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 2) or (left_in_government = 0 and resources >= 2)
unavailable-subtitle: The framework has no implementation reserve.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.left_in_government) {
    Q.budget -= 2;
    Q.labor_credibility += 7;
    Q.workers_support += 5;
    Q.government_delivery += 4;
    Q.fiscal_stress += 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The bargaining statute receives institutions capable of using it";
} else {
    Q.resources -= 2;
    Q.labor_credibility += 5;
    Q.workers_support += 3;
    Q.local_network += 3;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Opposition unions build registration support while ministries control enforcement";
}
!}
go-to: poland_event_queue

@bargaining_claim
title: Claim the statute and leave implementation to ministries
subtitle: Media +2 and labour credibility +2; public trust −1 for weak implementation.
on-arrival: media_capacity += 2; labor_credibility += 2; government_delivery += 1 if left_in_government = 1; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "The Left wins a labour headline before workplace coverage changes"
go-to: poland_event_queue

